  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Shimmer Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A wet-pressed talc-free highlighter powder that melts into skin for a transparent, glistening finish on the face and eyes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Passion Fruit Extract: Moisturizes and conditions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Unique powder technology locks in moisture for luminosity that lets skin shine through—no chalkiness or glittery fallout. This highlighter was clinically tested to improve skin smoothness. You can wear it everywhere—it blends easily with fingers for concentrated shine or a brush for a diffused glow. It is also talc- and silicone-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Wear it everywhere.<br>-Sweep or dab with a brush or finger wherever you want to glisten: the cheeks, eyelids, inner corners of eyes, brow bone, nose, even collarbones and shoulders.<br>-Use it at any step in your makeup routine. It layers effortlessly and plays well with creams, liquids, and powders.<br>-Use your fingers. Press finger firmly into the powder, then onto skin for high sheen and payoff.<br>-Use a brush. For a soft diffused glow, use the Kosas Face Detailer (sold separately) or any dense brush. Sponges are not recommended.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Passion Fruit Extract: Moisturizes and conditions.<br><br>Mica, C15-19 Alkane, Magnesium Stearate, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Lauroyl Lysine, Magnesium Myristate, Silica, Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Glyceryl Caprylate, Pentylene Glycol, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Water/Aqua/Eau, Tin Oxide, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, [+/-: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxide (CI 77491)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Shimmer Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A wet-pressed talc-free highlighter powder that melts into skin for a transparent, glistening finish on the face and eyes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Passion Fruit Extract: Moisturizes and conditions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Unique powder technology locks in moisture for luminosity that lets skin shine through—no chalkiness or glittery fallout. This highlighter was clinically tested to improve skin smoothness. You can wear it everywhere—it blends easily with fingers for concentrated shine or a brush for a diffused glow. It is also talc- and silicone-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Wear it everywhere.<br>-Sweep or dab with a brush or finger wherever you want to glisten: the cheeks, eyelids, inner corners of eyes, brow bone, nose, even collarbones and shoulders.<br>-Use it at any step in your makeup routine. It layers effortlessly and plays well with creams, liquids, and powders.<br>-Use your fingers. Press finger firmly into the powder, then onto skin for high sheen and payoff.<br>-Use a brush. For a soft diffused glow, use the Kosas Face Detailer (sold separately) or any dense brush. Sponges are not recommended.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Passion Fruit Extract: Moisturizes and conditions.<br><br>Mica, C15-19 Alkane, Magnesium Stearate, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Lauroyl Lysine, Magnesium Myristate, Silica, Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Glyceryl Caprylate, Pentylene Glycol, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Water/Aqua/Eau, Tin Oxide, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, [+/-: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxide (CI 77491)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
